      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following six customers are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems related to search relevance degradation after taxonomy changes: Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. Each of these accounts reported issues such as missing or low-ranked relevant incidents, poor and duplicate search results, misfiring playbook triggers, and increased manual triage time, all linked to taxonomy updates and schema registry mismatches.\n\nThere is no evidence in the provided data indicating that any of these North America West Event Nexus accounts are dealing with duplicate-action problems. The accounts with duplicate-action issues mentioned (e.g., role provisioning lag and duplicative accounts) are not among the North America West Event Nexus customers listed.\n\nTherefore, among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, all six identified are facing taxonomy/search semantics problems, and none are documented as dealing with duplicate-action problems in the supplied evidence. [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_d11447325b44]",
